21:T611,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I set up a corporate account for my Baar-based company?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Contact us directly to discuss your company's typical needs. We'll create a customized account with monthly invoicing, designated contact person, and any special requirements you have."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's the fastest way from Baar to Zurich Airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our direct taxi route typically takes 30 minutes via the A4 motorway. We recommend allowing 45-50 minutes total to account for any traffic variations and terminal navigation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer fixed prices for airport transfers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we provide fixed-price airport transfers from Baar to Zurich Airport. The exact rate depends on your pickup location within Baar – contact us for a quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you pick up my clients arriving at Zug station?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Meet-and-greet service at Zug station includes waiting with a name sign, assistance with luggage, and transport to your Baar office or specified destination."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is weekend service available in Baar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, we operate 24/7 including weekends. While business transport slows on weekends, we handle personal travel, airport transfers, and leisure trips throughout Baar."}}]}19:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TaxiService\",\"name\":\"Nova Taxi Baar\",\"description\":\"Taxi Baar – professional transport in Canton Zug's largest town. Corporate transfers, Zurich Airport, local rides. Nova Taxi 24/7.\",\"url\":\"https://www.nova-taxi.com/en/ort/baar\",\"telephone\":\"+41766113131\",\"email\":\"info@nova-taxi.com\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Baar\"},\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"name\":\"Nova Taxi\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Türlihof 4\",\"addressLocality\":\"Oberarth\",\"postalCode\":\"6414\",\"addressCountry\":\"CH\"},\"telephone\":\"+41766113131\",\"openingHoursSpecification\":{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":[\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\",\"Sunday\"],\"opens\":\"00:00\",\"closes\":\"23:59\"}}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$21"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container space-y-12","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400","aria-label":"Breadcrumb","children":[["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/en","className":"hover:text-white","children":"Home"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","$L15",null,{"href":"/en/kanton/zug","className":"hover:text-white","children":["Canton ","Zug"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white","children":"Baar"}]]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"space-y-4 max-w-4xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-nova-gold","children":"Professional Transport for Switzerland's Business Heartland"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-white","children":"Taxi Service in Baar"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"tel:+41766113131","className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-nova-gold px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-black hover:bg-nova-gold-soft transition-colors min-h-[48px]","data-testid":"phone-cta","children":"Book taxi: 076 611 31 31"}],"$L22"]}],"$L23","$L24","$L25"]}]}]]
22:["$","a",null,{"href":"https://wa.me/41766113131","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-600 px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-green-500 transition-colors min-h-[48px]","data-testid":"whatsapp-cta","children":"WhatsApp"}]
23:[["$","section",null,{"className":"prose prose-invert max-w-none","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4","children":"Reliable Taxi in Baar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"Baar has transformed from a quiet agricultural community into Canton Zug's most populous municipality and a major Swiss business center. International corporations, trading companies, and financial services firms cluster in its modern office parks, creating transport demands that require professional solutions."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Nova Taxi has evolved alongside Baar's commercial growth. We understand that in this environment, a delayed taxi can mean a missed meeting worth millions. Our reliability isn't just convenient – it's business critical."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"Yet Baar remains more than corporate headquarters. Traditional farming continues on the outskirts. The historic village center preserves its character. The Lorzentobel gorge offers unexpected wilderness minutes from glass towers. Our service connects all these Baar identities seamlessly."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-6 md:p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4","children":"Our Services in Baar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-4 mb-6","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"Corporate transport forms our core business in Baar. We maintain accounts with major companies, providing seamless billing, priority booking, and drivers who know individual corporate requirements. Regular passengers find their preferred routes and timing preferences remembered."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Zurich Airport access ranks among our most frequent requests. The 30-minute journey makes Baar exceptionally convenient for international business. We monitor flights, adjust for delays, and ensure executives arrive at their gates without stress."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"Intercantonal connections matter in Baar's networked business environment. Quick hops to Zug city, trips to Lucerne meetings, and transfers to Zurich offices all flow through our service. We think regionally while serving locally."}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-3","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-200","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-nova-gold flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Zurich Airport – 30 minutes direct"}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-200","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-nova-gold flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Corporate account management"}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-200","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-nova-gold flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Zug train station connections"}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-200","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-nova-gold flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Business park and office transfers"}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-200","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-nova-gold flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Executive airport meet-and-greet"}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-gray-200","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-nova-gold flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Confidential document transport available"}]]}]]}]]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28"]
